  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: portado (regular)",
    "*Portarse bien* = to behave well: *¡Pórtate bien!* = Behave yourself!",
    "*Portarse mal* = to behave badly / to misbehave",
    "*Portarse como* = to act like: *Se portó como un caballero* = He acted like a gentleman",
    "*Portarse bien con alguien* = to treat someone well: *Se portó muy bien conmigo* = He treated me very well",
    "Related: el comportamiento (behaviour), comportarse (to behave — synonym, more formal)"
  ],
